## Apply the patches

Replace `bana-io` with your username or change it to use HTTPS instead:

```sh
git clone git+ssh://bana-io@git.launchpad.net/~ubuntu-kernel/ubuntu/+source/linux/+git/resolute
cd resolute
BRANCH_NAME=$(PAGER=cat git tag -l Ubuntu-\* | grep -i $(uname -r | sed 's/-generic//'))
git checkout -b "${BRANCH_NAME}" "${BRANCH_NAME}"
```

It should checkout something like `Ubuntu-7.0.0-38.38`. Now apply the patch which I have generated against <https://github.com/aknautiyal/tip/tree/hdmi21_dev>:

```sh
wget 'https://blog.bana.io/ubuntu-build-your-own-kernel/files/hdmi21_dev.patch'
patch -p1 < ./hdmi21_dev.patch
```
